  "Every day it does its round without spending: it checks new agents, every other night it makes sure everyone has worked and left their mark, on Fridays it saves a backup, clears what's been dealt with, removes duplicate memories and makes sure nothing is sent, deleted or paid without your yes. On Mondays it reviews the costs, and only then does it use its brain, to say whether they pay off.": "Cada día hace su ronda sin gastar: revisa las altas, cada dos noches mira que todos hayan trabajado y dejado su señal, los viernes guarda una copia, recoge lo ya atendido, quita recuerdos repetidos y vigila que nada se envíe, se borre o se pague sin tu sí. Los lunes revisa los costes y solo entonces usa su cerebro, para decir si compensan.",
  "Follows every day how AI agents are moving forward and suggests improvements for the building to the boss. It uses internet search. When a new model comes out, it proposes it to you as a recommended one; you decide.": "Sigue cada día cómo avanzan los agentes de IA y propone al jefe mejoras para el edificio. Usa la búsqueda en internet. Cuando sale un modelo nuevo, te lo propone como recomendado; tú decides.",
