  "- {1} ({2}): {3}. The last thing it did: {4}": "- {1} ({2}): {3}. Lo último que hizo: {4}",
  "\nReply in 3 to 6 lines: which spending pays off, which doesn't, and what you'd change (cheaper brain, slower heartbeat, turn it off). No frills.": "\nResponde en 3 a 6 líneas: qué gasto compensa, cuál no, y qué cambiarías (cerebro más barato, latido más lento, apagar). Sin adornos.",
  "\n\nDetails:\n": "\n\nDetalle:\n",
  "cost review": "revisión de costes",
  " (I couldn't judge whether it pays off: ": " (No pude opinar si compensa: ",
  "warning": "aviso",
  "warnings": "avisos",
  "round with {1} {2}": "ronda con {1} {2}",
  "round: everything in order": "ronda: todo en orden",
  "Status report from {1}: {2}": "Parte de {1}: {2}",
  "There's no Agent Creator in the building. Fill in the profile by hand or install it from “Built-in agents”.": "No hay Creador de agentes en el edificio. Rellena la ficha a mano o instálalo desde «Agentes de serie».",
  "First describe what you want the agent to do.": "Describe primero qué quieres que haga el agente.",
  "no job": "sin función",
  "- id \"{1}\": {2} — {3} (head office: {4}; {5}/{6} offices; {7}/{8} in the pool)": "- id \"{1}\": {2} — {3} (despacho: {4}; {5}/{6} oficinas; {7}/{8} en el pool)",
  "(no floors yet)": "(no hay pisos todavía)",
  "Reply ONLY with a JSON object, nothing else, with these keys (keep the keys and the quoted option values exactly as written; write the texts in English):": "Responde SOLO con un objeto JSON, sin nada más, con estas claves (escribe las claves y los valores entre comillas exactamente como aparecen; los textos, en español):",
  "{\"name\": \"short and easy to remember\", \"role\": \"section_head\" | \"subagent\", \"floor\": \"id of an existing floor\" or \"new\", \"newFloor\": {\"name\": \"...\", \"job\": \"...\"} (only if floor is \"new\"), ": "{\"name\": \"corto y fácil de recordar\", \"role\": \"section_head\" | \"subagent\", \"floor\": \"id de un piso existente\" o \"new\", \"newFloor\": {\"name\": \"...\", \"job\": \"...\"} (solo si floor es \"new\"), ",
  "\"seat\": \"head_office\" (section head only) | \"office\" | \"pool\" (for simple, cheap sub-agents), \"instructions\": \"full instructions in the second person, 60-200 words\", \"objective\": \"one sentence\", ": "\"seat\": \"head_office\" (solo jefe de sección) | \"office\" | \"pool\" (para subagentes sencillos y baratos), \"instructions\": \"instrucciones completas en segunda persona, 60-200 palabras\", \"objective\": \"una frase\", ",
  "\"personality\": \"one or two sentences: its tone, its humour and whether it gets to the point\", ": "\"personality\": \"una o dos frases: su tono, su humor y si va al grano\", ",
  "\"level\": \"budget\" | \"mid\" | \"high\", \"heartbeat\": {\"every\": number, \"unit\": \"min\" | \"h\" | \"d\" | \"on_request\"}, \"onWake\": \"tasks\" | \"objective\", ": "\"level\": \"budget\" | \"mid\" | \"high\", \"heartbeat\": {\"every\": número, \"unit\": \"min\" | \"h\" | \"d\" | \"on_request\"}, \"onWake\": \"tasks\" | \"objective\", ",
  "\"capabilities\": list of [": "\"capabilities\": lista de [",
  "], \"look\": {\"p\": \"boy\" | \"girl\" | \"grandpa\" | \"grandma\", \"clothes\": \"#rrggbb\", \"hair\": \"#rrggbb\", \"eyes\": \"#rrggbb\"}, \"why\": \"one sentence: why this design and roughly how much it will spend\"}": "], \"look\": {\"p\": \"boy\" | \"girl\" | \"grandpa\" | \"grandma\", \"clothes\": \"#rrggbb\", \"hair\": \"#rrggbb\", \"eyes\": \"#rrggbb\"}, \"why\": \"una frase: por qué este diseño y cuánto gastará más o menos\"}",
  "Rules: the cheapest brain that can do it well; the slowest heartbeat that will do (every minute costs a lot); “search” only if it really needs the internet; if the work is big and repetitive, a section head with sub-agents in the pool. ": "Reglas: el cerebro más barato que pueda hacerlo bien; latido lo más lento que sirva (cada minuto gasta mucho); «search» solo si de verdad necesita internet; si el trabajo es grande y repetitivo, un jefe de sección con subagentes en el pool. ",
  "If the right floor doesn't exist, propose a new one with its job. Never give it capabilities to send, delete or pay. ": "Si el piso adecuado no existe, propón uno nuevo con su función. Nunca le des capacidades para enviar, borrar o pagar. ",
  "In the instructions, don't attribute tools, sub-agents, access or data it doesn't have: only what it can really do with its capabilities. ": "En las instrucciones no le atribuyas herramientas, subagentes, accesos ni datos que no tenga: solo lo que de verdad puede hacer con sus capacidades. ",
  "Personality: if you're given one, use it as it is; if not, propose a short one (tone, humour and whether it gets to the point) and mention it in “why” so your owner can change it if they want.": "Personalidad: si te la dicen, úsala tal cual; si no, propón una corta (tono, humor y si va al grano) y dilo en «why» para que tu dueño la cambie si quiere.",
  "Floors of the building:\n": "Pisos del edificio:\n",
  "Who's already in the building:\n": "Quién hay ya en el edificio:\n",
  "\n\nPersonality your owner wants: ": "\n\nPersonalidad que quiere tu dueño: ",
